{
  "_doc": "Anh xa F<nn> -> route, ban 2. Khac ban 1 (apps/mobile/tests/qa-114244/anh-xa-f-route.json) o DON VI: ban 1 tim route theo KHAI NIEM DAC TRUNG cua ten tinh nang, va khi khong tim thay thi tra ve rong -> doc thanh 'may chu khong co gi'. Ban 2 tach lam HAI TRUC roi rac.",
  "_truc_1_du_lieu": "du_lieu_routes = route DOC hoac GHI du lieu ma DOAN SPEC cua tinh nang do goi ten (nguon: product/feature_list.md, danh tu tai nguyen trich bang may, khong phai tu tieu de). Mot route duoc phep phuc vu NHIEU tinh nang. Ban 1 gan gan nhu doc quyen 1 route -> 1 tinh nang, nen tinh nang nao dung chung du lieu voi hang xom thi nhan tap rong.",
  "_truc_2_nang_luc": "nang_luc_route = route DANH RIENG cho nang luc dac trung cua tinh nang (thu ma thieu no thi tinh nang khong con la chinh no). null = may chu chua co. null O DAY KHONG co nghia la 'khong co API' -- do la dung cai loi ban 1 mac phai.",
  "_phan_loai": "A = du_lieu_routes khong rong VA nang_luc_route != null. P = du_lieu_routes khong rong VA nang_luc_route == null (co API cho du lieu, chua co route cho nang luc rieng). E = du_lieu_routes RONG (khong route nao cham du lieu cua tinh nang).",
  "_doi_chung": "F05/F16/F22 phai ra 'CO API' (A hoac P). Doi chung am o cuoi file phai ra E, neu khong thi phep dem khong con phan biet duoc gi.",

  "F01": {"ten": "Account Registration", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /identity/person-id", "PUT /people/{person_id}"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /identity/person-id"},
  "F02": {"ten": "Personal Profile", "du_lieu_routes": ["PUT /people/{person_id}", "GET /people/{person_id}/finance", "POST /people/{person_id}/avatar", "GET /people/{person_id}/avatar"], "nang_luc_route": "GET /people/{person_id}/finance"},
  "F03": {"ten": "Add Friends", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /friends/lookup", "GET /people/{person_id}/friends"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /friends/lookup"},
  "F04": {"ten": "Friend Request", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /friends/requests", "POST /friends/requests/{request_id}/respond", "GET /people/{person_id}/friend-requests"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /friends/requests"},
  "F05": {"ten": "QR Friend Add", "du_lieu_routes": ["GET /people/{person_id}/friends", "POST /friends/lookup", "POST /friends/requests"], "nang_luc_route": null,
          "ghi_chu": "Du lieu = profile + friends (spec dong 166: 'Scan QR -> mo profile -> Add friend'). Ba route tren deu 200 that. Nang luc rieng = sinh/quet ma QR tro toi profile: khong route nao. Grep 'qr' trong app/api/ chi ra VietQR cua duong thanh toan, la nang luc KHAC."},
  "F06": {"ten": "Create Group", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /contexts", "GET /contexts/{context_id}", "POST /contexts/{context_id}/members", "GET /contexts/{context_id}/members"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /contexts"},
  "F07": {"ten": "Group Chat", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /contexts/{context_id}/messages", "GET /contexts/{context_id}/messages"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /contexts/{context_id}/messages"},
  "F08": {"ten": "AI Member", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /contexts/{context_id}/ai-turn", "GET /contexts/{context_id}/messages"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /contexts/{context_id}/ai-turn"},
  "F09": {"ten": "Discover Places", "du_lieu_routes": ["GET /places"], "nang_luc_route": "GET /places"},
  "F10": {"ten": "Place Detail", "du_lieu_routes": ["GET /places/{place_id}"], "nang_luc_route": "GET /places/{place_id}"},
  "F11": {"ten": "AI Place Match", "du_lieu_routes": ["GET /contexts/{context_id}/suggestion", "GET /places"], "nang_luc_route": "GET /contexts/{context_id}/suggestion"},
  "F12": {"ten": "Natural Language Place Search", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /places/search", "GET /places"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /places/search"},
  "F13": {"ten": "Create Outing", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /contexts/{context_id}/outings", "GET /contexts/{context_id}/outings"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /contexts/{context_id}/outings"},
  "F14": {"ten": "Invite Members", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /outings/{outing_id}/invites", "POST /outing-invites/{token}/accept", "POST /memberships/{membership_id}/accept", "POST /outings/{outing_id}/invites/{invite_id}/revoke"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /outings/{outing_id}/invites"},
  "F15": {"ten": "Outing Timeline", "du_lieu_routes": ["PUT /outings/{outing_id}/timeline", "GET /contexts/{context_id}/outings"], "nang_luc_route": "PUT /outings/{outing_id}/timeline"},
  "F16": {"ten": "AI Itinerary Generator", "du_lieu_routes": ["GET /contexts/{context_id}/outings", "POST /contexts/{context_id}/outings", "PUT /outings/{outing_id}/timeline"], "nang_luc_route": null,
          "ghi_chu": "Du lieu = yeu cau chuyen di + lich trinh theo gio (spec dong 391). GET /contexts/{id}/outings tra 200 kem 'Chuyen Da Lat thang 6' voi starts_on/ends_on/headcount/budget_per_person_vnd/stops -- dung du lieu spec mo ta. Nang luc rieng = AI SINH lich trinh: app/api/service.py:2236 replace_outing_timeline ghi audit 'edit_outing_timeline' -- no LUU lich trinh, khong SINH. POST /contexts/{id}/ai-turn la AI nhom dung chung, khong danh rieng."},
  "F17": {"ten": "Voting", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /contexts/{context_id}/votes", "GET /contexts/{context_id}/votes", "GET /votes/{vote_id}", "POST /votes/{vote_id}/ballots", "POST /votes/{vote_id}/close"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /votes/{vote_id}/ballots"},
  "F18": {"ten": "Receipt OCR", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /receipts/scan"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /receipts/scan"},
  "F19": {"ten": "Bill Item Detection", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /receipts/scan", "POST /bills", "GET /bills/{bill_id}"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /receipts/scan"},
  "F20": {"ten": "Assign Food To Person", "du_lieu_routes": ["PUT /bills/{bill_id}/assignments", "POST /bills/{bill_id}/my-items", "GET /bills/{bill_id}"], "nang_luc_route": "PUT /bills/{bill_id}/assignments"},
  "F21": {"ten": "AI Person Recognition", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /contexts/{context_id}/photos/{photo_id}/face-boxes", "POST /contexts/{context_id}/photos"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /contexts/{context_id}/photos/{photo_id}/face-boxes"},
  "F22": {"ten": "Visual Food Participation Detection", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /contexts/{context_id}/photos", "POST /bills/{bill_id}/my-items", "PUT /bills/{bill_id}/assignments", "GET /bills/{bill_id}"], "nang_luc_route": null,
          "ghi_chu": "Du lieu = anh ban an + hoa don + danh sach mon/nguoi an (spec dong 534). POST /bills/{id}/my-items tra 200 kem items[] va assignment_state. Nang luc rieng = AI nhin anh ban an suy ra AI AN GI: khong route nao. face-boxes la nhan dien NGUOI (F21), khong phai mon an."},
  "F23": {"ten": "Confidence Score", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /receipts/scan", "GET /bills/{bill_id}"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /receipts/scan"},
  "F24": {"ten": "Expense Creation From Chat", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /contexts/{context_id}/messages/{message_id}/expense-draft", "POST /expenses"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /contexts/{context_id}/messages/{message_id}/expense-draft"},
  "F25": {"ten": "Expense Creation From Receipt", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /bills", "POST /bills/{bill_id}/split", "POST /expenses"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /bills/{bill_id}/split"},
  "F26": {"ten": "Expense Creation From Screenshot", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /screenshots/scan", "POST /expenses"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /screenshots/scan"},
  "F27": {"ten": "Smart Settlement", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /bills/{bill_id}/split", "POST /expenses", "POST /expenses/{expense_id}/confirm", "POST /batches"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /batches"},
  "F28": {"ten": "Settlement Tracking", "du_lieu_routes": ["GET /batches/{batch_id}/obligations", "POST /obligations/{obligation_id}/confirm-receipt", "GET /contexts/{context_id}/balances"], "nang_luc_route": "GET /batches/{batch_id}/obligations"},
  "F29": {"ten": "Payment Link / QR", "du_lieu_routes": ["POST /batches/{batch_id}/publish", "GET /g/{token}", "PUT /people/{person_id}/bank-recipient", "GET /people/{person_id}/bank-recipient", "POST /bank-recipients", "GET /bank-recipients/{recipient_id}"], "nang_luc_route": "POST /batches/{batch_id}/publish"},
